  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest,",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06e535963fcd98f3ba24/step-03bffc00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice lemon into wedges. Finely chop garlic. Thinly slice zucchini into sticks.\n• Trim baby broccoli and halve any large stalks lengthways.\n• In a small bowl, combine Greek style yoghurt and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06e535963fcd98f3ba24/step-ec189010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook baby broccoli and zucchini, tossing, until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant.\n• Remove from heat then add a good squeeze of lemon juice. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06e535963fcd98f3ba24/step-8bfe4d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide seared haloumi and garlic greens between plates.\n• Serve with lemony yoghurt and any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06e535963fcd98f3ba24/step-84273330.jpg"
    }
  ]
